<%- include('../partials/head',{title}) %>
<%- include('../partials/header',{settings}) %>
<main id="main-content">
  <%- include('../partials/public-hero') %>
  <section class="section care-intro"><div class="container section-heading centered reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">Exclusive services</span><h2>Care that adapts to the person.</h2><p>Families stay informed and involved while residents receive the right balance of assistance, encouragement and independence.</p></div><div class="container care-card-grid">
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-person-circle-check"></i></span><h3>Personal Care &amp; ADLs</h3><p>Assistance with bathing, dressing, grooming, toileting, eating, mobility and transferring—always delivered respectfully.</p></article>
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-pills"></i></span><h3>Medication Support</h3><p>Medication reminders, administration and tracking to help residents follow their prescribed routines.</p></article>
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i></span><h3>Health Monitoring</h3><p>Attentive observation of vital signs, symptoms and changes, with prompt communication when concerns arise.</p></article>
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-people-arrows"></i></span><h3>Care Coordination</h3><p>Clear collaboration among healthcare providers, family members, therapists and the Gracious care team.</p></article>
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-face-laugh-beam"></i></span><h3>Social &amp; Emotional Care</h3><p>Companionship, group activities, outings and meaningful engagement that support connection and joy.</p></article>
    <article class="care-card reveal"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-hands-praying"></i></span><h3>Spiritual Wellbeing</h3><p>Respectful access to faith, cultural activities and spiritual encouragement that bring comfort and peace.</p></article>
  </div></section>

  <% const specializedSection = pageSections.find(s=>s.seedKey==='care-specialized'); if(specializedSection){ %><%- include('../partials/page-section',{section:specializedSection,settings}) %><% } %>

  <section class="amenities-section"><div class="container amenities-layout"><div class="amenities-title reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Thoughtful comforts</span><h2>Amenities that make daily life easier.</h2><p>Everything is arranged to support comfort, safety, nutrition and meaningful independence.</p><a class="btn btn-light" href="/living">See Our Living Spaces <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="amenity-list reveal">
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i> Newly remodeled home with private bedrooms</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-house-medical"></i> Access to concierge physicians or nurses</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-utensils"></i> Three nutritious meals plus daily snacks</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-sun-plant-wilt"></i> Screened porch, large backyard and garden</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i> Intentionally low caregiver-to-resident ratio</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-car-side"></i> Transportation for appointments and outings</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-broom-ball"></i> Housekeeping and laundry support</span>
    <span><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece"></i> Wellness programs and recreational activities</span>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section faq-section"><div class="container faq-layout"><div class="section-copy reveal"><span class="eyebrow dark">Common questions</span><h2>Clarity for your family’s decision.</h2><p>Every situation is personal. These answers are a starting point, and our team is ready to talk through the details with you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Ask us a question <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="accordion" data-accordion>
    <article class="accordion-item reveal"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How is a resident’s care plan created?</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="accordion-panel"><p>We begin with the resident’s needs, routines, preferences, health information and family input. The plan is reviewed as needs evolve.</p></div></article>
    <article class="accordion-item reveal"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can families remain involved in care?</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="accordion-panel" hidden><p>Yes. Open communication with families and healthcare providers is central to coordinated, consistent support.</p></div></article>
    <article class="accordion-item reveal"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Do you support short-term stays?</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="accordion-panel" hidden><p>Respite care may be available for temporary stays. Contact our team to discuss timing, needs and availability.</p></div></article>
    <article class="accordion-item reveal"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>How can we know whether Gracious is the right fit?</span><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="accordion-panel" hidden><p>A personal conversation and tour are the best next steps. We will listen carefully and answer questions honestly so your family can decide with confidence.</p></div></article>
  </div></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer',{settings}) %>
